/*!
\page page_stbtofheader StBTofHeader

\brief Event-level header data for the STAR Barrel TOF (BTOF) detector, including VPD summary.

\section btofheader_overview Overview

StBTofHeader stores per-event timing and VPD (Vertex Position Detector) information
collected alongside the BTOF data.
It has been present since Run 8 (2007) and provides:

- Per-fiber DAQ header and trigger words for the four BTOF fibers.
- VPD hit-pattern bitmasks, individual tube times, and vertex z candidates.
- The event start time (t0) derived from VPD timing, used for all BTOF TOF calculations.
- Bookkeeping of BTOF hits used in the t0 determination.

The VPD has up to 19 tubes on each side (east/west).
The time difference between east and west signals encodes the collision z-vertex.

The object is held by \ref StBTofCollection via StEvent::btofCollection()->tofHeader().

\section btofheader_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
TObject → StObject → StBTofHeader
\endcode

\section btofheader_members Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| mFiberHeader[4] | Short_t | DAQ header words per fiber |
| mFiberTriggerWord[4] | UInt_t | Trigger words per fiber |
| mVpdHitPattern[2] | UInt_t | VPD tube bitmasks: [0]=east, [1]=west |
| mVpdVz[20] | Float_t | VPD vertex z candidates [cm] |
| mTStart | Double_t | Event start time [ns] |
| mTStartErr | Double_t | Uncertainty on start time [ns] |
| mTDiff | Double_t | VPD east–west time difference [ns] |
| mVpdTime[2][19] | Double_t | Individual VPD tube times [ns] |
| mTriggerTime[4] | UInt_t | Trigger time TDC counts per fiber |
| mNTzero | Short_t | BTOF hits used for t0 |
| mNTzeroCan | Short_t | BTOF hits in t0 candidate sample |
| mTCanFirst | Double_t | Earliest t0 candidate time [ns] |
| mTCanLast | Double_t | Latest t0 candidate time [ns] |
| mVpdEHits | Double_t | Number of VPD east hits |
| mVpdWHits | Double_t | Number of VPD west hits |
| mEarliestVpdEHit | Double_t | Earliest VPD east hit time [ns] |
| mEarliestVpdWHit | Double_t | Earliest VPD west hit time [ns] |

\section btofheader_methods Key Methods

- tStart() — event start time from VPD [ns]
- tStartError() — uncertainty on start time [ns]
- vpdVz(rank=0) — VPD vertex z estimate [cm]
- tDiff() — east–west time difference [ns]
- numberOfVpdHits(side) — fired VPD tube count for east or west
- isVpdHit(side, tubeId) — true if tube fired
- vpdTime(side, tubeId) — calibrated tube time [ns]
- nTzero() — BTOF hits used for t0
- triggerTime(fiberId) — trigger TDC count for fiber

\section btofheader_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StBTofCollection* coll = event->btofCollection();
if (coll) {
    StBTofHeader* hdr = coll->tofHeader();
    if (hdr) {
        double t0    = hdr->tStart();
        float  vz    = hdr->vpdVz();
        auto   nVpdE = hdr->numberOfVpdHits(east);
        auto   nVpdW = hdr->numberOfVpdHits(west);
        int    nT0   = hdr->nTzero();
    }
}
\endcode

\see StBTofHit, StBTofRawHit, StBTofCollection
*/
